+% caption interface (float first aid)
+\subsection{\cs{caption*} with the \pkg{float} package}
+
+The \pkg{float} package replaces \cs{caption} by a definition that does
+not know the star form, so \verb|\caption*{Text}| gave a numbered caption
+with the text `*' and a list entry. As \pkg{float} is no longer
+maintained, \pkg{latex-firstaid} now lets \cs{caption*} use the kernel
+definition when \pkg{float} is loaded. Floats restyled by \pkg{float}
+keep the layout of their style.
+
